      "isolated_context": "Conrad Brooks is an American actor. He was born as Conrad Biedrzycki on January 3, 1931, in Baltimore, Maryland. He moved to Hollywood, California in 1948 to pursue a career in acting. He appeared in Ed Wood films such as \"Plan 9 from Outer Space\", \"Glen or Glenda\", and \"Jail Bait.\" He took a break from acting during the 1960s and 1970s but reemerged in the 1980s due to ongoing interest in Ed Wood's films. He has also written, produced, and directed several films."
